@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@
+# Voice Capture Helper changes
+
+This fork keeps CallVault's proven no-root Embedded ADB / Wireless Debugging setup and persistent
+shell-UID recorder daemon, and adds a private raw-audio bridge for one receiver application.
+
+## Contract
+
+- Helper application ID: com.sara.voicecapturehelper
+- Allowed receiver application ID: com.reiceve.voice
+- Provider URI: content://com.sara.voicecapturehelper.recorder/far-party-pcm
+- Mode: read-only
+- Stream: headerless PCM16LE, mono, 48,000 Hz
+- Capture: far party only; no microphone and no near/far downmix
+- Storage permissions: none
+
+The receiver opens the URI after a WhatsApp call is answered and closes it when the call ends. A
+reliable ParcelFileDescriptor pipe transports audio directly from the privileged daemon, through the
+helper provider, to the receiver. Closing the reader produces a broken pipe in the daemon and releases
+the AudioRecord.
+
+Every newly connected daemon arms VoipAudioPolicy immediately. This must happen before WhatsApp
+creates its USAGE_VOICE_COMMUNICATION playback track.
+
+## Upstream and license
+
+Based on madkongo/CallVault. The upstream GPL-3.0-or-later license and its additional terms remain in
+LICENSE. Source recipients must retain and comply with them.
diff --git a/app/src/main/java/com/baba/callvault/server/FarPartyPcmSession.kt b/app/src/main/java/com/baba/callvault/server/FarPartyPcmSession.kt
