+++ b/b4a/README.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,28 @@
+B4A receiver package name must be:
+com.reiceve.voice
+
+Required libraries:
+- JavaObject
+- RandomAccessFile (for AsyncStreams)
+
+1. Add ManifestSnippet.txt content to the B4A manifest editor.
+2. Add FarPartyPcmReceiver.bas as a class module.
+3. Declare and initialize it:
+
+Private FarVoice As FarPartyPcmReceiver
+FarVoice.Initialize(Me, "FarVoice")
+
+4. After the WhatsApp call is answered:
+FarVoice.Start
+
+5. Receive arbitrary-size PCM chunks:
+
+Sub FarVoice_Pcm(Buffer() As Byte)
+    'Feed Buffer to your VAD / streaming STT queue.
+End Sub
+
+6. At call end:
+FarVoice.Stop
+
+Audio format: raw PCM16 little-endian, mono, 48000 Hz, no WAV header.
+No storage permission is required.
